From 5f0cc00e1f51f35ceb6a64a4eb2635cea5427485 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 24 May 2026 19:52:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace NGX with European + Asian stocks (real OHLCV,
 multi-currency)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Remove all Nigerian Exchange (NGX) code and synthetic price history
- Add EU_STOCKS: 29 stocks (UK LSE, France CAC40, Germany DAX, Swiss SIX, NL, DK, IT)
- Add ASIA_STOCKS: 20 stocks (Japan TSE, HK HKEX, India NSE, South Korea KRX, US-listed ADRs)
- All EU/Asian tickers use yfinance natively — real OHLCV history available immediately
- Multi-currency support: GBP(p), EUR(€), JPY(¥), HKD(HK$), INR(₹), KRW(₩), CHF(Fr), DKK(kr)
- Dashboard KPIs: ASML (EU) replaces DANGCEM (NGX) as reference stock
- Predictor: 3-market toggle (EU / ASIA / US) replaces 2-market NGX/US toggle
- Scanner: separate EU, ASIA, US filter buttons
- Trade journal: EU, ASIA, US market options with correct currency symbols
- Remove Supabase dependency (no longer needed — yfinance has years of real history)
- Expected ML accuracy improvement: ~53% (synthetic NGX) → ~57-62% (real OHLCV)

https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPbiGiwrv1HzUMgtDGA8wQ
